        "created_at": "2021-05-04T14:09:30.591Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A howling good time.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-175-creative-process-werewolf-stories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-175-creative-process-werewolf-stories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #175 - Creative Process: Werewolf Stories</a></h3>\n\n<p>Bark at the moon! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:35:52 We start off by talking about Adam's sleep schedule, which is appropriate as this is the first episode of Adam's Birth Month! Thrilling times! Then, we get to all the wolfs. We tell you more about a...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
