        "created_at": "2021-05-04T17:22:35.882Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Adam goes to bed earlier than I do! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> He must be getting old.</p>\n<p>Anyone want to take bets on whether Alpha is the new hero appearing in the next DE expansion? Christopher’s either hinted or outright said that there will be one. It’d make sense, since I could see Apex fitting in as a villain deck, and she’s an obvious go-to for a nemesis.</p>\n<p>And can I just say… AWOOOOOOO! Werewolves of Haka!</p>",
