        "created_at": "2021-05-05T18:51:19.429Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s amusing how many canonical things started out as a non-canonical sketch. Dr. Medico started out that way, right?</p>\n<p>My impression is that Adam did Inktober without wanting to worry about whether or not things were cannon, but the canonical status can change over time.</p>",
